{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2Fundamental","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2Fundamental","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.RMatrixSl2","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Kronecker","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Reindex","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":46,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheckAt_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheckAt_sq","kind":"theorem","line":424,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L424-L435","doc":"Each `Ř_{i,i+1}` on `V^{⊗n}` still satisfies the §7a Hecke quadratic\n`Ř² = (q − q⁻¹)Ř + 1` (from `QOU.IwahoriHecke.RMatrix.rCheck_sq`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.isEndo_rCheckAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.isEndo_rCheckAt","kind":"theorem","line":411,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L411-L420","doc":"**`q`-Schur–Weyl, intertwining half, all `n`.** Every adjacent Jimbo `Ř_{i,i+1}` on\n`V^{⊗n}` commutes with `Δ^{(n)}(E)`, `Δ^{(n)}(F)`, `Δ^{(n)}(K^{±1})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheckAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheckAt","kind":"def","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L403-L409","doc":"**`Ř` acting on tensor factors `m+1, m+2` of `V^{⊗(m+2+k)}`** (1-indexed), i.e. on\n`V^{⊗m} ⊗ (V ⊗ V) ⊗ V^{⊗k}`: `1 ⊗ Ř` re-associated, then `⊗ 1` on each of the `k`\ntrailing factors. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.powRep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.powRep","kind":"def","line":397,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L397-L400","doc":"`V^{⊗n}` with the iterated coproduct `Δ^{(n)}`, built as `(…((𝟙 ⊗ V) ⊗ V)…) ⊗ V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.TP.instDecidableEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.TP.instDecidableEq","kind":"instance","line":391,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L391-L393","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.TP.instFintype","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.TP.instFintype","kind":"instance","line":387,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L387-L389","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.TP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.TP","kind":"def","line":382,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L382-L385","doc":"Index type of `V^{⊗n}`, left-nested: `TP 0 = Unit`, `TP (n+1) = TP n × Fin 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.isEndo_kohnoRCheck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.isEndo_kohnoRCheck","kind":"theorem","line":366,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L366-L373","doc":"**The `KohnoTwoPoint` form of `Ř` commutes with `Δ` of the textbook fundamental**\n(`K = diag(q, q⁻¹)`), after the lexicographic identification `Fin 2 × Fin 2 ≃ Fin 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_Km","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_Km","kind":"theorem","line":357,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L357-L364","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_Kp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_Kp","kind":"theorem","line":347,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L347-L354","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_F","kind":"theorem","line":337,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L337-L344","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂_commute_E","kind":"theorem","line":326,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L326-L333","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.reindex_kohnoRCheck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.reindex_kohnoRCheck","kind":"theorem","line":316,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L316-L322","doc":"The lexicographic identification `Fin 2 × Fin 2 ≃ Fin 4` carries `kohnoRCheck` to\n`kohnoRCheck₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck₂","kind":"def","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L309-L314","doc":"The same matrix, indexed by `Fin 2 × Fin 2`: `q` on `e_i ⊗ e_i`, the flip off the\ndiagonal, and `q − q⁻¹` on `e₁ ⊗ e₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kohnoRCheck","kind":"def","line":301,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L301-L307","doc":"A verbatim copy of `QOU.Mass.KohnoTwoPoint.rCheck` (that module has no olean in the\nrestored cache, so it is not imported; the body is the same `!![…]` literal). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.isEndo_rCheck","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.isEndo_rCheck","kind":"theorem","line":293,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L293-L299","doc":"**Jimbo's `Ř` commutes with `Δ(E)`, `Δ(F)`, `Δ(K^{±1})` on `V ⊗ V`.**\n`Ř = QOU.IwahoriHecke.RMatrix.rCheck q q⁻¹` (the corpus's matrix, imported, not copied),\n`V = fund`, `Δ` as in `Rep.tensor`. This is the `n = 2` intertwining half of `q`-Schur–Weyl. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_Km","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_Km","kind":"theorem","line":284,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L284-L291","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_Kp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_Kp","kind":"theorem","line":274,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L274-L281","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_F","kind":"theorem","line":264,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L264-L271","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.rCheck_commute_E","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L253-L260","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.fund'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.fund'","kind":"def","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L226-L241","doc":"**The fundamental, textbook convention** (highest weight on `e₀`): `K = diag(q, q⁻¹)`,\n`E e₁ = e₀`, `F e₀ = e₁`. This is the one matching `QOU.Mass.KohnoTwoPoint.rCheck`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.fund","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.fund","kind":"def","line":208,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L208-L224","doc":"**The fundamental of `U_q(sl₂)`, highest weight on `e₁`** (the convention matching\n`QOU.IwahoriHecke.RMatrix.rCheck`): `K = diag(q⁻¹, q)`, `E e₀ = e₁`, `F e₁ = e₀`.\nNote `q · K = diag(1, q²)`, the weight operator of `QOU.MassTheory.WeightedPermutationCharacter`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.trivial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.trivial","kind":"def","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L188-L198","doc":"The trivial one-dimensional representation (the counit): `E = F = 0`, `K^{±1} = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.isEndo_assoc_symm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.isEndo_assoc_symm","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L176-L186","doc":"Endomorphisms of `ρ ⊗ (σ ⊗ τ)` pull back along the associator to endomorphisms of\n`(ρ ⊗ σ) ⊗ τ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.coassoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.coassoc","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L164-L174","doc":"**Coassociativity of `Δ`**, generator by generator: the associator carries\n`(Δ ⊗ id) ∘ Δ` to `(id ⊗ Δ) ∘ Δ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.one_eq_kron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.one_eq_kron","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L160-L162","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.assoc","kind":"def","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L154-L158","doc":"The associator `(ι × κ) × ν ≃ ι × (κ × ν)` acting on matrices, as an algebra equivalence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.isEndo_one_kronecker","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.isEndo_one_kronecker","kind":"theorem","line":143,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L143-L150","doc":"Endomorphisms of the right factor commuting with `K^{±1}` extend: `1 ⊗ T`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.isEndo_kronecker_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.isEndo_kronecker_one","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L134-L141","doc":"Endomorphisms of the left factor extend: `T ⊗ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.tensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.tensor","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L99-L132","doc":"**The coproduct.** Convention:\n`Δ(E) = E ⊗ K + 1 ⊗ E`, `Δ(F) = F ⊗ 1 + K⁻¹ ⊗ F`, `Δ(K^{±1}) = K^{±1} ⊗ K^{±1}`.\nThis is proved to be a representation, i.e. `Δ` respects all the relations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.IsEndo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.IsEndo","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L95-L97","doc":"`T` commutes with all four generators: an endomorphism of the representation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Kp_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Kp_F","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L89-L93","doc":"`K F = q⁻² F K`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.E_Km","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.E_Km","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L83-L87","doc":"`E K⁻¹ = q² K⁻¹ E`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kronecker_sub'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.kronecker_sub'","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L74-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.sub_kronecker'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.sub_kronecker'","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L70-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.EF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.EF","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.KF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.KF","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.KE","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.KE","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Km_Kp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Km_Kp","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Kp_Km","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Kp_Km","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Km","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Km","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L63-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Kp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.Kp","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.F","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.E","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.E","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep.mk","kind":"ctor","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L59-L59","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.QuantumSl2.Rep","kind":"structure","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/QuantumSl2Fundamental.lean#L56-L68","doc":"**Representation data of `U_q(sl₂)`** on `𝕜^ι`: four matrices `E, F, K, K⁻¹`\nsatisfying the defining relations `KK⁻¹ = K⁻¹K = 1`, `KEK⁻¹ = q²E`, `KFK⁻¹ = q⁻²F`,\n`[E,F] = (K − K⁻¹)/(q − q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}